Package: cli-assistant
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CLI assistant for Linux system administration
 cli-assistant is a fast command line assistant for Linux system
 administration: ask questions in natural language and get answers from any
 OpenAI-compatible API.
 .
 The c client talks to the clad daemon over the system D-Bus. The daemon holds
 the API credentials, talks to the backend and stores conversation history in
 SQLite. The interactive and TUI chat modes carry recent turns as conversation
 context and compact long histories into a summary automatically.
 .
 Run "sudo c setup" after installation to configure the endpoint, API key and
 model.
